STDOUT_BEGIN
# NetBoost

Mobile-first connection diagnostics and safe browser-level optimization.

NetBoost reports browser-visible network information, measures same-origin round-trip latency, supports an offline shell, and stores the data-saving preference locally.

NetBoost cannot increase carrier signal strength, bypass data caps, override Android radio limits, or create bandwidth unavailable from the network.
STDOUT_END
